    ],
    "note": "16-bit Deluxe Classics need a 32-bit Wine prefix (Wine Prefix Wizard \u2192 Architecture: 32-bit), named after-dark-win16 unless you pick another. Import this script into that bottle. If After Dark is already installed in a 64-bit prefix, SCR Saver copies Deluxe Classics plus OldMod16 and the 16-bit engine into the 32-bit bottle. If not, run Typical Install from your After Dark CD into the 32-bit prefix first, then import again. Prefer ADESETUP.EXE in the ADE folder. Skip the disc's DirectX, After Dark Online, and AT&T WorldNet. This Wine must support WINEARCH=win32; wow64-only Wine cannot run these modules."
  }
